    "site_desc": "Located in a pasture setting. It is surrounded by a horse pasture, trees to the east and west, some to the north; pond to the S-SW. Obstructions within 100m include trees, paved road. The soil type is Barbour loam.  This site is a part of the New York State Mesonet Flux Network, one of multiple subnetworks (e.g. Profiler, Snow) operated by the New York State Mesonet. It also operates as a Snow and Standard meteorological site.",
